{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rom-2-1","title":"Romans 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 No excuse for sin. 6 No escape from judgment. 14 Gentiles cannot; 17 nor Jews.</p>\n<p>Therefore. 1:18-20 O man. 3; 9:20; 1Co 7:16; Jas 2:20 whosoever. 26,27; 2Sa 12:5-7; Ps 50:16-20; Mt 7:1-5; 23:29-31; Lu 6:37; 19:22 Joh 8:7-9; Jas 4:11 for thou that. 3,21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-2","title":"Romans 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>judgment. 5; 3:4,5; 9:14; Ge 18:25; Job 34:17-19,23; Ps 9:4,7,8; 11:5-7; 36:5,6 Ps 96:13; 98:9; 145:17; Isa 45:19,21; Jer 12:1; Eze 18:25,29 Da 4:37; Zep 3:5; Ac 17:31; 2Th 1:5-10; Re 15:3,4; 16:5; 19:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-3","title":"Romans 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thinkest. 2Sa 10:3; Job 35:2; Ps 50:21; Mt 26:53 O man. 1; Da 10:19; Lu 12:14; 22:58,60 that thou shalt. 1:32; Ps 56:7; Pr 11:21; 16:5; Eze 17:15,18; Mt 23:33; 1Th 5:3 Heb 2:3; 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-4","title":"Romans 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>despisest. 6:1,15; Ps 10:11; Ec 8:11; Jer 7:10; Eze 12:22,23; Mt 24:48,49 2Pe 3:3 riches. 9:23; 10:12; 11:33; Ps 86:5; 104:24; Eph 1:7,18; 2:4,7; 3:8,16 Php 4:19; Col 1:27; 2:2; 1Ti 6:17; Tit 3:4-6 forbearance. 3:25; 9:22; Ex 34:6; Nu 14:18; Ps 78:38; 86:15; Isa 30:18; 63:7-10 Jon 4:2; 1Ti 1:16; 1Pe 3:20 goodness. Job 33:27-30; Ps 130:3,4; Isa 30:18; Jer 3:12,13,22,23; Eze 16:63 Ho 3:5; Lu 15:17-19; 19:5-8; 2Pe 3:9,15; Re 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-5","title":"Romans 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>But afte