 11:14; Php 4:8 are a law. 12; 1:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-15","title":"Romans 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>written. 1:18,19 their conscience, etc. or, the conscience witnessing withthem. 9:1; Joh 8:9; Ac 23:1; 24:16; 2Co 1:12; 5:11; 1Ti 4:2; Tit 1:15 the mean while. or, between themselves. accusing. Ge 3:8-11; 20:5; 42:21,22; 1Ki 2:44; Job 27:6; Ec 7:22; 1Jo 3:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-16","title":"Romans 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>God. 5; 3:6; 14:10-12; Ge 18:25; Ps 9:7,8; 50:6; 96:13; 98:9; Ec 3:17; 11:9 Ec 12:14; Mt 16:27; 25:31-46; Lu 8:17; Joh 12:48; 1Co 4:5; 2Co 5:10 Heb 9:27; 1Pe 4:5; 2Pe 2:9; Re 20:11-15 by Jesus. Joh 5:22-29; Ac 10:42; 17:31; 2Ti 4:1,8 according. 16:25; 1Ti 1:11; 2Ti 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-17","title":"Romans 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>thou art. 28,29; 9:4-7; Ps 135:4; Isa 48:1,2; Mt 3:9; 8:11,12; Joh 8:33 2Co 11:22; Ga 2:15; Eph 2:11; Php 3:3-7; Re 2:9; 3:1,9 restest. 23; 9:4,32; Jer 7:4-10; Zep 3:11; Lu 10:28; Joh 5:45; 7:19; 9:28,29 makest. Isa 45:25; 48:2; Mic 3:11; Joh 8:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-18","title":"Romans 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>knowest. De 4:8; Ne 9:13,14; Ps 147:19,20; Lu 12:47; Joh 13:17; 1Co 8:1,2 Jas 4:17 approves the things that are more excellent. or, triest thethings that differ. Php 1:10; *marg: 1Th 5:21; Heb 5:14 being instructed. 15:4; Ps 19:8; 119:98-100,104,105,130; Pr 6:23; 2Ti 3:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-19","title":"Romans 2:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>art confident. Pr 26:12; Isa 5:21; 56:10; Mt 6:23; 15:14; 23:16-26; Mr 10:15 Joh 7:46-49; 9:34,40,41; 1Co 3:18; 4:10; 8:1,2; Re 3:17,18 a light. Isa 49:6,9,10; Mt 4:16; 5:14; Lu 1:79; Ac 26:18; Php 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-20","title":"Romans 2:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>a teacher. Mt 11:25; 1Co 3:1; Heb 5:13; 1Pe 2:2 the form. 6:17; 2Ti 1:13; 3:5; Tit 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-21","title":"Romans 2:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>therefore. Ps 50:16-21; Mt 23:3-12; Lu 4:23; 11:46; 12:47; 19:22; 1Co 9:27 Ga 6:13; Tit 2:1-7 dost thou steal. Isa 56:11; Eze 22:12,13,27; Am 8:4-6; Mic 3:11; Mt 21:13; 23:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-22","title":"Romans 2:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>adultery. Jer 5:7; 7:9,10; 9:2; Eze 22:11; Mt 12:39; 16:4; Jas 4:4 sacrilege. Mal 1:8,14; 3:8; Mr 11:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-23","title":"Romans 2:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>that makest. 17; 3:2; 9:4; Jer 8:8,9; Mt 19:17-20; Lu 10:26-29; 18:11; Joh 5:45 Joh 9:28,29; Jas 1:22-27; 4:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-24","title":"Romans 2:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the name. Isa 52:5; La 2:15,16; Eze 36:20-23; Mt 18:7; 1Ti 5:14; 6:1 Tit 2:5,8 as it is written. 2Sa 12:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-25","title":"Romans 2:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>circumcision. 28,29; 3:1,2; 4:11,12; De 30:6; Jer 4:4; Ga 5:3-6; 6:15; Eph 2:11,12 but if. 23; Jer 9:25,26; Ac 7:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-26","title":"Romans 2:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Isa 56:6,7; Mt 8:11,12; 15:28; Ac 10:2-4,34,35; 11:3-18 1Co 7:18,19; Php 3:3; Col 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-27","title":"Romans 2:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>if it fulfil. 8:4; 13:10; Mt 3:15; 5:17-20; Ac 13:22; Ga 5:14 judge. Eze 16:48-52; Mt 12:41,42; Heb 11:3 by the. 20,29; 7:6-8; 2Co 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-28","title":"Romans 2:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>For he. 9:6-8; Ps 73:1; Isa 1:9-15; 48:1,2; Ho 1:6-9; Mt 3:9; Joh 1:47 Joh 8:37-39; Ga 6:15; Re 2:9 neither. Jer 9:26; Ro 4:10-12; 1Pe 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-2-29","title":"Romans 2:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>which. 1Sa 16:7; 1Ch 29:17; Ps 45:13; Jer 4:14; Mt 23:25-28; Lu 11:39 Lu 17:21; Joh 4:23; 1Pe 3:4 circumcision. De 10:16; 30:6; Jer 4:4; Col 2:11,12 spirit. 27; 7:6; 14:17; Joh 3:5-8; 2Co 3:6; Php 3:3 whose. Joh 5:44; 12:43; 1Co 4:5; 2Co 10:18; 1Th 2:4; 1Pe 3:4</p>"}]}